OL,3,GNEWSABees create a buzz at Liverpool
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liverpool shopping centre's lesser
OL,7,Fknown tenants are creating a buzz.
OL,9,FSt Johns Shopping Centre has thousands
OL,10,Fof bees in hidden hives on the roof and
OL,11,Fsome of the staff have even had
OL,12,Fbeekeeper training.
OL,14,FTwo hives were installed in 2021 and a
OL,15,Fthird was set up last year. During
OL,16,Fsummer peaks the hives become home to
OL,17,Fabout 180,000 of the striped insects.
OL,19,FThey produced a bumper amount of honey
OL,20,Fthis year - enough for 150 jars of the
OL,21,Fsweet nectar - and local school
OL,22,Fchildren are helping design the labels.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
